data/99/qa/audit.log:26:- **Every culled pocket classified** (all 23, by bbox not centroid — the printed centroids are non-convex-region means and several land outside their own pocket): 3740 = west wall band + Seafood staff wedge (purple); 1973 = Pharmacy room; 1827 = Admin; 2044/901 = 4–6 pt wall slivers hugging the NW and SW walls; 525 = unlabelled 1 m slot between the Beer/Wine block and the aisle-1 gondola; 456/440/330/286 = Business Center + the three lease rooms; 214/187/185/184/183/178/158 = checkout lanes; 162/135/135 = Card & Party corridors, restored by the existing inclusion and verified reachable; 144 = dead strip at the Bakery's north wall (no label); 101 = east-wall sliver at the Cosmetics/pharmacy corner. Only #327 was a defect.
data/99/qa/audit.log:28:- **All 37 aisle corridors measured full length** from their badges; east-wing 22–37 all run x≈894 to the east wall/pharmacy/Admin wall.
