docs/plan.md:319:- **Phase 1.5 — done (2026-07-21→22, unplanned pull-forward of P2 #17).** **Universal map pipeline — data, not code.** Extraction/build/QA code frozen and store-agnostic; ALL store-specific truth lives in `data/<N>/` JSON (geometry, zones, seal_zones, exclusions, inclusions, walk_truth); zones/seal-zones auto-derive from extracted labels; #659 pixel-golden regression (`golden_free.npy`). Headless-agent onboarding runbook (`docs/onboarding.md`) + independent adversarial audit role (`docs/audit.md`); coverage nets (unreachable-shelf-labels, sealed-floor-patches) added after store 24 shipped with its pharmacy wing sealed and every other signal green; `discover.py` + `pipeline.sh` as the autonomous acquisition interface (Q8: URL pattern confirmed). **Stores onboarded: #24, #388 (fragmented guide), #790 (Plano); #265 (Cedar Park, raster-scan guide) in flight** on the guarded raster-extraction fallback (`router/raster.py` — OCR, deskew, boundary discovery).
